        "line": 200,
        "text": "theorem axial_chain_coefficient {q : ℝ} (hq : 0 < q)\n    (b h η X F FX Fη : ℝ) :\n    b * q ^ (b - 1) * qAxial q h η * F +\n        q ^ b * (FX * xAxial q h η X + Fη * etaAxial q h η) =\n      q ^ (b - D h) * axialCoeff b h η X F FX Fη"
      }
